    "description": "A dense, multibranched deciduous maple eventually about 3m tall, with distinctive buds clustered together creating a growth habit with twists and tufts of layered leaves a shiny, deep green, edged red when young, then turning to shades of yellow and gold in autumn; ideal for bonsai training",
